  "passage": "Welcome to the Riverside School Creative Writing Club's homepage! Our club is a brilliant place for students who enjoy writing stories and poems. We meet every Friday after school in the library, near the town's bookstore. Last term, we had a trip to the bookstore for a book signing event. In our meetings, members share their work and receive helpful feedback. Recently, we explored writing about childhood experiences. One member wrote a secret poem that was very touching. Our instructor, Ms. Clarke, is a young and energetic teacher who guides us. We provide self-service drinks and snacks, so you can relax while you write. If you want to join, come to our next meeting. It's not so-so – it's fantastic! Visit our homepage for more information. We also share writing tips and event news there.",
